1
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,000
[25 °C]

2
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:34,500
25 degrees Celsius and clear weather!

3
00:00:38,810 --> 00:00:40,520
The weather is nice today!

4
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,010
Good morning, my little trees.

5
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:45,220
Here, have some water.

6
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,910
You're still looking good as always.

7
00:00:52,210 --> 00:00:53,800
Today is definitely a good day.

8
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:59,120
Today's lucky color is brown...

9
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:01,400
brown...

10
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:02,530
this one...

11
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,070
this one is also brown...

12
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,000
They're all brown.

13
00:01:13,710 --> 00:01:14,710
Okay!

14
00:01:46,810 --> 00:01:48,210
The west wall is

15
00:01:48,230 --> 00:01:49,960
10 centimeters off the blueprint.

16
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:59,200
They said this is as far as it can go.

17
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,730
It's already up against the top wall.

18
00:02:02,740 --> 00:02:05,010
I've already accounted
for that in the plans.

19
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,200
If we don't fix it,

20
00:02:06,220 --> 00:02:08,300
the circulation, perspective, skylight,

21
00:02:08,330 --> 00:02:09,280
everything will be compromised.

22
00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:11,420
The aesthetics, functionality, and cost

23
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,480
will all suffer more than
the time it takes to fix this.

24
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:14,990
What should we do?

25
00:02:16,890 --> 00:02:17,710
Alright.

26
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:19,520
I'll tell the workers to break this down.

27
00:02:21,510 --> 00:02:22,510
Thank you.

28
00:02:23,110 --> 00:02:24,980
Next time, if you want to change the plans,

29
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,300
tell me before the construction starts.

30
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:29,100
We're working together,

31
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:31,090
I'm not supposed to guess what you want.

32
00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:37,920
Oud,

33
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,600
I need to talk to you.

34
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,670
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

35
00:03:20,610 --> 00:03:21,610
What?

36
00:03:21,790 --> 00:03:22,790
What are you looking at?

37
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,410
So brave.

38
00:03:25,430 --> 00:03:26,830
So bold.

39
00:03:26,850 --> 00:03:29,120
Wearing red on review day.

40
00:03:31,610 --> 00:03:33,000
What red, ma'am?

41
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:34,520
This is wine red.

42
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:37,900
Red is red, no matter the shade.

43
00:03:38,130 --> 00:03:40,290
But you especially shouldn't wear it today.

44
00:03:41,220 --> 00:03:44,910
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

45
00:03:45,050 --> 00:03:45,810
Why?

46
00:03:46,170 --> 00:03:47,680
Because red...

47
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:51,560
is today's unlucky color!

48
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,350
- Unlucky?!
- Unlucky?!

49
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:29,440
[Built in Love]

50
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,530
Mim.

51
00:05:36,130 --> 00:05:37,920
Meet me in the meeting room.

52
00:05:39,210 --> 00:05:40,700
Yes, Soul.

53
00:05:48,420 --> 00:05:49,120
Stop it!

54
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:51,530
Didn't Pat give you guys
enough work or what,

55
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,850
Thanwa, Mek?

56
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:55,130
We do have work.

57
00:05:55,300 --> 00:05:57,220
But we're the handsome team,

58
00:05:57,410 --> 00:05:59,020
so we get it done fast.

59
00:05:59,230 --> 00:06:00,210
That's right!

60
00:06:02,010 --> 00:06:03,810
We're not making sour faces

61
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:05,210
like Oyl, are we?

62
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:08,620
I'm making a face because of you guys,

63
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,490
damn jerks.

64
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,530
Don't touch me.

65
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,050
Stop it.

66
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:17,100
Or you'll find out

67
00:06:17,130 --> 00:06:19,310
who's going to be the unlucky one today.

68
00:06:19,910 --> 00:06:21,530
Come on, Oyl.

69
00:06:21,570 --> 00:06:22,520
We have a meeting,

70
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,420
or Soul will chew us out.

71
00:06:24,730 --> 00:06:25,730
Yes.

72
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:26,810
Hurry up!

73
00:06:26,870 --> 00:06:29,010
Unlucky this, unlucky that.

74
00:06:29,510 --> 00:06:31,390
You keep going on about it.

75
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,910
I hope it strikes you instead.

76
00:06:34,330 --> 00:06:35,620
Sadhu.

77
00:06:37,430 --> 00:06:38,080
What?

78
00:06:38,100 --> 00:06:38,890
What are you looking at?!

79
00:06:39,110 --> 00:06:40,300
I'll poke your eyes out!

80
00:06:44,530 --> 00:06:47,020
I'm late, so late, so late!

81
00:06:48,620 --> 00:06:49,760
Xinxin!

82
00:06:49,790 --> 00:06:51,840
Breakfast is ready. Come eat first.

83
00:06:52,230 --> 00:06:53,780
I don't have time, Mom!

84
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,580
I'll come home for dinner, okay?

85
00:06:55,610 --> 00:06:56,780
- I'm already running late.
- Sure.

86
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,050
Oh, wait, wait!

87
00:06:58,070 --> 00:06:59,640
I packed some fruit for you, too.

88
00:07:00,510 --> 00:07:01,790
Thanks, Mom.

89
00:07:01,810 --> 00:07:03,200
See you this evening.

90
00:07:03,410 --> 00:07:04,740
I'll eat this in the car.

91
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:06,070
Okay, come...

92
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,710
Tie your shoes properly,

93
00:07:12,730 --> 00:07:14,400
so you won't trip!

94
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:18,000
Are you ready to go now?

95
00:07:19,930 --> 00:07:20,890
Oh no!

96
00:07:21,030 --> 00:07:21,930
What do you mean?

97
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,650
I stepped out with my right foot first.

98
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:31,050
Oh? I'm sure it's fine, dear.

99
00:07:31,810 --> 00:07:34,300
It's not, Mom...

100
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:38,010
Then what should...

101
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,140
Let's do this instead.

102
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,160
To ward off bad luck.

103
00:07:44,010 --> 00:07:45,360
Careful, dear!

104
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:48,910
Are you going to hop
all the way to the car?

105
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:51,970
- Oh...
- Bye-bye, Mom!

106
00:07:52,620 --> 00:07:54,010
Bye-bye, dear.

107
00:07:56,420 --> 00:07:57,790
I go by my schedule,

108
00:07:57,810 --> 00:07:58,890
not lucky dates.

109
00:07:59,530 --> 00:08:00,420
Sorry.

110
00:08:01,290 --> 00:08:02,180
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

111
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,120
We can start now.

112
00:08:05,620 --> 00:08:06,700
For the interior walls,

113
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:09,050
we'll use vertical lines
like those on the building

114
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,800
to create a sense of space and height.

115
00:08:11,820 --> 00:08:12,820
As for the lobby,

116
00:08:12,850 --> 00:08:14,310
I've planned the indirect lighting system

117
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:16,870
to complement your skylight

118
00:08:16,890 --> 00:08:19,210
and enhance the natural light

119
00:08:19,230 --> 00:08:20,310
rather than compete with it.

120
00:08:27,540 --> 00:08:28,540
Okay,

121
00:08:29,260 --> 00:08:30,170
looks good.

122
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:32,190
You can continue.

123
00:08:41,010 --> 00:08:43,920
Excuse me, Soul,
I need to answer this call.

124
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,900
- Is this the time for that?
- Hello, yes...

125
00:08:51,110 --> 00:08:52,090
What did our client choose?

126
00:08:52,110 --> 00:08:54,090
Oh? This one.

127
00:08:54,110 --> 00:08:55,040
Soul!

128
00:08:55,060 --> 00:08:55,930
Soul!

129
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:56,730
We're in trouble!

130
00:08:56,830 --> 00:08:58,020
Madam Waen just called.

131
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,710
She said you have to meet her
at her house as soon as possible,

132
00:09:00,740 --> 00:09:02,670
- Hey...
- or she'll terminate our company's contract.

133
00:09:02,690 --> 00:09:03,490
Hey!

134
00:09:03,530 --> 00:09:05,720
Why? What happened?!

135
00:09:05,740 --> 00:09:07,930
I was just talking to her last month!

136
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,040
There weren't any problems,

137
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:12,070
and construction's already underway.

138
00:09:12,090 --> 00:09:14,370
How could there be a problem now?!

139
00:09:15,530 --> 00:09:16,530
Soul!

140
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,860
Wait for me, Soul!

141
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:26,910
House number 859/5...

142
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,460
What do you think?

143
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,480
Is it good?

144
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:33,440
Your house number...

145
00:09:35,370 --> 00:09:36,450
is auspicious.

146
00:09:37,620 --> 00:09:39,090
Five means happiness,

147
00:09:39,110 --> 00:09:40,730
eight means wealth,

148
00:09:40,820 --> 00:09:43,370
and nine means prosperity.

149
00:09:43,390 --> 00:09:44,460
According to belief,

150
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:47,530
living here will bring you
ever-growing wealth.

151
00:09:49,980 --> 00:09:50,850
But...

152
00:09:50,870 --> 00:09:52,180
But what?

153
00:09:52,290 --> 00:09:53,960
According to the texts,

154
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:55,730
the right side represents fire,

155
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:57,380
and the left represents water,

156
00:09:57,450 --> 00:09:59,070
so they must be balanced.

157
00:09:59,090 --> 00:10:00,970
The design is correct,

158
00:10:00,990 --> 00:10:03,010
with water flowing in front of the house.

159
00:10:03,030 --> 00:10:04,280
But the fountain

160
00:10:04,300 --> 00:10:05,860
should be on the left

161
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:06,980
to bring peace to the house.

162
00:10:07,160 --> 00:10:09,030
If it's slightly to the right,

163
00:10:09,060 --> 00:10:10,910
there'll be an imbalance
between water and fire,

164
00:10:10,930 --> 00:10:12,130
like Yin and Yang.

165
00:10:12,290 --> 00:10:14,330
This area should be adjusted.

166
00:10:14,350 --> 00:10:15,500
Not a chance!

167
00:10:24,310 --> 00:10:25,610
Here comes bad luck...

168
00:10:25,630 --> 00:10:26,700
What are you saying?!

169
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:28,630
I'm not.

170
00:10:28,980 --> 00:10:29,580
Uh...

171
00:10:29,710 --> 00:10:31,500
This is Soul,

172
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,520
the architect overseeing this house,

173
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:35,730
and this is Xinxin, a feng shui master.

174
00:10:36,710 --> 00:10:38,920
Hello, Miss...

175
00:10:39,370 --> 00:10:40,370
Architect.

176
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:44,020
Hello,

177
00:10:44,050 --> 00:10:45,400
Miss Feng...

178
00:10:45,420 --> 00:10:46,420
Shui!

179
00:10:47,310 --> 00:10:48,960
My bonus is so gone...

180
00:10:52,830 --> 00:10:54,770
They're not even calling
each other by name.

181
00:10:54,790 --> 00:10:56,090
You sure they will be alright?

182
00:10:56,110 --> 00:10:56,900
I wonder.

183
00:11:00,050 --> 00:11:02,600
The reason I asked you to come so urgently

184
00:11:02,630 --> 00:11:04,020
is that I want to

185
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:06,620
make some changes to this house
to align with feng shui principles.

186
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:08,730
But your house is almost finished, madam.

187
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:10,530
Oh, no worries!

188
00:11:10,710 --> 00:11:13,690
If this house doesn't align with
feng shui principles,

189
00:11:13,710 --> 00:11:15,900
I wouldn't feel comfortable living here.

190
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:18,060
It has nothing to do with feng shui.

191
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,500
Of course it does.

192
00:11:19,910 --> 00:11:21,400
Because a house is the first gateway

193
00:11:21,420 --> 00:11:24,010
that opens the way
to the residents' fortune.

194
00:11:26,110 --> 00:11:27,710
I'm not talking to you,

195
00:11:27,730 --> 00:11:29,020
Miss Feng Shui.

196
00:11:33,020 --> 00:11:33,920
Soul...

197
00:11:33,940 --> 00:11:35,380
calm down.

198
00:11:35,410 --> 00:11:36,300
Keep repeating this.

199
00:11:36,330 --> 00:11:39,730
Bonus, bonus, bonus...

200
00:11:44,310 --> 00:11:45,220
Madam,

201
00:11:45,310 --> 00:11:47,040
what would you like to change?

202
00:11:47,210 --> 00:11:49,240
If it's not too much work,

203
00:11:49,260 --> 00:11:51,650
we won't charge you extra.

204
00:11:52,170 --> 00:11:53,840
Well...

205
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:56,220
Tear it down.

206
00:11:57,810 --> 00:12:01,180
Five, six, seven, eight, nine.

207
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:04,430
The number of lights in a house
shouldn't be odd.

208
00:12:04,450 --> 00:12:05,570
From what I can see,

209
00:12:05,590 --> 00:12:07,890
they’re in odd numbers
from the gate all the way inside.

210
00:12:07,910 --> 00:12:09,370
That's against the principles,

211
00:12:09,390 --> 00:12:12,300
because it'll leave the residents
single for life.

212
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:15,500
So the lights in the house
should be in even numbers,

213
00:12:15,530 --> 00:12:17,320
Miss Architect.

214
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:22,230
All the doors

215
00:12:22,250 --> 00:12:23,850
shouldn't be aligned.

216
00:12:24,110 --> 00:12:25,290
Tear it down.

217
00:12:25,310 --> 00:12:26,210
Huh?!

218
00:12:26,230 --> 00:12:27,430
The door

219
00:12:28,010 --> 00:12:29,310
and balcony

220
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:31,220
shouldn't be aligned.

221
00:12:32,020 --> 00:12:33,020
Tear it down.

222
00:12:38,700 --> 00:12:39,700
Also...

223
00:12:53,740 --> 00:12:55,510
From what I've explained,

224
00:12:55,530 --> 00:12:58,460
do you still have a question,
Miss Architect?

225
00:12:58,500 --> 00:12:59,500
I do.

226
00:13:00,210 --> 00:13:01,210
What is it?

227
00:13:01,230 --> 00:13:02,900
I'll explain it again.

228
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:06,700
Everything you've mentioned.

229
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:07,780
I don't understand

230
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:10,120
why a feng shui master like you
needs to change the house plans

231
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:11,890
when the original one is already good.

232
00:13:11,910 --> 00:13:13,580
And some of the things you've suggested

233
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:16,260
can't be changed to
comply with feng shui principles

234
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:17,920
because they're not practical,

235
00:13:17,940 --> 00:13:19,820
and make my job much harder.

236
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,650
The person responsible for this project

237
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:23,810
will end up finishing late, too.

238
00:13:26,020 --> 00:13:26,860
But...

239
00:13:27,250 --> 00:13:29,310
isn't it an architect's job

240
00:13:29,710 --> 00:13:32,040
to build a house to suit its occupants?

241
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:36,460
It is.

242
00:13:36,490 --> 00:13:37,910
But if the occupants

243
00:13:37,930 --> 00:13:39,490
trust the feng shui master more,

244
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:41,720
then why not let
the feng shui master build it?

245
00:13:42,900 --> 00:13:43,820
Oh?!

246
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,180
Why are you being so harsh?

247
00:13:45,460 --> 00:13:46,390
Goodbye.

248
00:13:46,410 --> 00:13:47,660
Soul!

249
00:13:48,810 --> 00:13:51,060
Why is she being so harsh with me?

250
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:53,220
I'm sorry, madam. I'm so sorry.

251
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,840
I'm sorry.

252
00:13:54,860 --> 00:13:55,890
Soul!

253
00:13:55,910 --> 00:13:56,490
Gosh...

254
00:13:56,510 --> 00:13:57,700
- Miss Architect!
- Harsh!

255
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:59,110
- Oh... oh...
- Oh no, madam!

256
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:01,080
I need my inhaler.

257
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:04,110
I've never heard anything
so unpleasant in my life.

258
00:14:04,130 --> 00:14:05,190
Take a breath...

259
00:14:09,860 --> 00:14:11,030
Soul!

260
00:14:11,050 --> 00:14:11,860
Soul!

261
00:14:11,880 --> 00:14:12,810
Soul!

262
00:14:13,210 --> 00:14:13,750
Soul!

263
00:14:13,770 --> 00:14:15,560
Calm down, will you?

264
00:14:15,710 --> 00:14:17,620
- About what we've talked...bonus...
- Wait!

265
00:14:21,620 --> 00:14:22,550
Oyl,

266
00:14:22,570 --> 00:14:23,600
wait in the car.

267
00:14:24,910 --> 00:14:26,380
But, Soul...

268
00:14:26,950 --> 00:14:27,950
please calm down.

269
00:14:28,290 --> 00:14:29,630
Wait in the car.

270
00:14:33,670 --> 00:14:34,410
Yes...

271
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:43,180
Your design goes against
feng shui principles.

272
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:44,930
Living here would be like
being in an oven,

273
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,390
your love life would be rocky,

274
00:14:46,410 --> 00:14:47,930
and your finances would hit a roadblock.

275
00:14:47,950 --> 00:14:48,870
Wow...

276
00:14:48,990 --> 00:14:51,120
How much did madam pay you

277
00:14:51,140 --> 00:14:54,090
to go this far with the feng shui stuff?

278
00:14:56,300 --> 00:14:59,200
You can make up stories
to fool madam all you want,

279
00:14:59,420 --> 00:15:00,900
but not me.

280
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:02,260
I don't believe in it.

281
00:15:04,220 --> 00:15:06,400
It's understandable
if you don't believe it,

282
00:15:06,710 --> 00:15:08,150
so let's meet halfway.

283
00:15:08,410 --> 00:15:09,070
Huh?

284
00:15:09,490 --> 00:15:10,680
Halfway?

285
00:15:11,510 --> 00:15:13,790
Whatever you can change,

286
00:15:13,810 --> 00:15:15,320
go ahead and do it.

287
00:15:16,020 --> 00:15:18,100
And for the parts you can't change,

288
00:15:18,130 --> 00:15:20,530
I'll find a way to boost the energy.

289
00:15:21,630 --> 00:15:23,200
Listen,

290
00:15:23,410 --> 00:15:25,450
I'm not changing!

291
00:15:27,030 --> 00:15:28,150
Wait!

292
00:15:28,170 --> 00:15:29,920
What now?

293
00:15:43,510 --> 00:15:45,930
Overall, you have good features.

294
00:15:47,530 --> 00:15:49,080
Your brows are uneven.

295
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:51,580
According to the texts,
you'll have a short temper.

296
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:54,730
But...

297
00:15:55,660 --> 00:15:56,610
But what?

298
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,690
A broad forehead

299
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,010
brings fortune.

300
00:16:01,820 --> 00:16:03,510
Your nose is prominent,

301
00:16:03,610 --> 00:16:04,670
well-defined,

302
00:16:04,690 --> 00:16:05,970
but isn't too sharp.

303
00:16:06,130 --> 00:16:08,130
That means you're grounded

304
00:16:08,150 --> 00:16:09,510
and reliable.

305
00:16:12,270 --> 00:16:12,990
What else?

306
00:16:13,010 --> 00:16:14,530
Finish what you were saying.

307
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:15,510
See?

308
00:16:15,710 --> 00:16:16,810
You really are short-tempered.

309
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:23,410
Overall, you look good,

310
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:26,330
but you'll be unlucky in love.

311
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:29,820
Like I said.

312
00:16:29,930 --> 00:16:30,930
With a mouth like that,

313
00:16:31,110 --> 00:16:32,820
who's going to fall for you?

314
00:16:47,630 --> 00:16:49,170
I’m withdrawing from this project.

315
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:50,820
No, Soul, you can't!

316
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,190
The boss will chew us out.

317
00:16:53,110 --> 00:16:54,600
Please calm down, Soul.

318
00:16:55,190 --> 00:16:56,410
Just let someone else do it.

319
00:16:56,430 --> 00:16:58,050
I'm not the only one in this company.

320
00:16:58,190 --> 00:17:00,770
But Madam Waen specifically requested you!

321
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:02,090
That's right.

322
00:17:02,310 --> 00:17:03,800
Please think it over again.

323
00:17:04,340 --> 00:17:07,310
I mean, this is a big project, too.

324
00:17:14,730 --> 00:17:15,730
Yes, boss?

325
00:17:16,130 --> 00:17:17,130
Boss?

326
00:17:18,410 --> 00:17:19,520
But boss, it's...

327
00:17:23,620 --> 00:17:24,620
Understood.

328
00:17:28,170 --> 00:17:29,320
How'd it go?

329
00:17:29,340 --> 00:17:30,570
What did the boss say?

330
00:17:30,820 --> 00:17:31,820
Right.

331
00:17:32,290 --> 00:17:33,570
Go get her number.

332
00:17:34,950 --> 00:17:36,010
Whose number?

333
00:17:37,420 --> 00:17:38,730
That feng shui lady's.

334
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,990
Huh? How would I have her number?

335
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:42,050
Wait.

336
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,970
I just remembered that
the pretty feng shui master

337
00:17:43,990 --> 00:17:46,020
might've given me her card.

338
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:48,670
Can you stop calling that problematic
feng shui master "pretty"?

339
00:17:48,690 --> 00:17:49,820
It's really annoying.

340
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:50,910
Huh?

341
00:17:51,710 --> 00:17:53,130
But she's really pretty.

342
00:17:53,810 --> 00:17:57,010
Oyl calls every single girl pretty, Soul.

343
00:17:58,700 --> 00:17:59,530
True,

344
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:01,000
except for one person.

345
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:01,970
Who?

346
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:03,310
You.

347
00:18:03,510 --> 00:18:04,250
Hey!

348
00:18:05,010 --> 00:18:06,010
Here you go.

349
00:18:06,290 --> 00:18:07,670
- Go away! Back off!
- I'll be right back, Soul.

350
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:08,450
Go away!

351
00:18:08,590 --> 00:18:09,590
- Hey!
- Ow!

352
00:18:24,010 --> 00:18:25,410
What's the matter, dear?

353
00:18:25,870 --> 00:18:27,830
You're eating like you're mad at someone.

354
00:18:31,430 --> 00:18:32,770
You noticed?

355
00:18:32,850 --> 00:18:34,650
Why wouldn't I?

356
00:18:34,810 --> 00:18:36,580
You look all restless and irritable,

357
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:39,110
and you're eating so much.
That's your second plate, dear.

358
00:18:39,370 --> 00:18:40,110
Why?

359
00:18:40,130 --> 00:18:41,770
Did you get a fussy customer?

360
00:18:42,710 --> 00:18:44,520
Not a customer,

361
00:18:44,620 --> 00:18:46,120
but an

362
00:18:46,250 --> 00:18:48,050
architect.

363
00:18:48,230 --> 00:18:49,520
Mom, I don't understand

364
00:18:49,530 --> 00:18:52,820
why my client trusts a feng shui master
more than an architect.

365
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:56,330
It gives them peace of mind, sweetie.

366
00:18:56,420 --> 00:18:57,420
But, Mom!

367
00:18:57,430 --> 00:18:59,850
It doesn't give me any peace of mind!

368
00:19:00,050 --> 00:19:01,730
Customer satisfaction

369
00:19:01,750 --> 00:19:04,290
should always come first, right, Mom?

370
00:19:04,510 --> 00:19:05,840
That's true, dear. But...

371
00:19:05,860 --> 00:19:09,150
you need to learn to
work things out together,

372
00:19:09,170 --> 00:19:10,530
talk things through with
kindness and patience.

373
00:19:10,620 --> 00:19:11,700
Wouldn't that be better?

374
00:19:13,820 --> 00:19:16,100
Maybe not this one yet, Mom.

375
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:17,830
We're not compatible.

376
00:19:18,150 --> 00:19:20,050
We don't click.

377
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:21,500
Come on...

378
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:24,320
Wouldn't it be better to
find a way to work together?

379
00:19:24,340 --> 00:19:26,930
It's a small industry, after all.

380
00:19:26,950 --> 00:19:28,550
After a project or two,

381
00:19:28,570 --> 00:19:30,250
you'll end up crossing paths again.

382
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:33,490
- I have to see her again?
- Mm.

383
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:37,050
Sadhu, sadhu, sadhu.

384
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:38,730
Just wait and see, Mom!

385
00:19:38,750 --> 00:19:39,910
I will

386
00:19:39,930 --> 00:19:42,080
bring every god to fight her.

387
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:43,850
Every god!

388
00:19:44,150 --> 00:19:45,520
But if I can choose,

389
00:19:45,540 --> 00:19:47,700
I hope we don't see each other again.

390
00:19:48,046 --> 00:19:50,700
How could you not see each other again?

391
00:19:50,820 --> 00:19:52,310
An architect and a feng shui master

392
00:19:52,486 --> 00:19:54,130
are a showdown waiting to happen.

393
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,510
Mom...

394
00:19:55,530 --> 00:19:57,030
I don't want a rival.

395
00:19:57,100 --> 00:19:58,850
I just want to do my job.

396
00:20:03,220 --> 00:20:04,810
Calm down.

397
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:07,690
Don't overdo it, dear.

398
00:20:08,620 --> 00:20:10,520
You're all I have.

399
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:13,880
You're all I have, too, Mom,

400
00:20:13,900 --> 00:20:15,450
so don't worry.

401
00:20:17,470 --> 00:20:18,470
Come on.

402
00:20:18,730 --> 00:20:20,870
Eat up. I made all this for you.

403
00:20:21,650 --> 00:20:22,720
- They're all your favorites.
- Okay.

404
00:20:23,630 --> 00:20:24,630
Thank you.

405
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:35,750
Renita Rungruengumporn.

406
00:20:39,450 --> 00:20:40,910
That name sounds familiar.

407
00:20:51,060 --> 00:20:52,360
[Feng shui by Xinxin]

408
00:20:52,380 --> 00:20:53,706
[Feng Shui by Xinxin:
The Art of Fate and Feng Shui]

409
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:55,040
[Feng Shui by Xinxin:
The Art of Fate and Feng Shui]

410
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,300
Whoa...

411
00:20:56,320 --> 00:20:58,700
She has this many followers?!

412
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:02,050
[Billionaire 'Witaya Rungruengumporn',

413
00:21:02,070 --> 00:21:03,120
Automotive Business Owner,
and His Family Story]

414
00:21:03,150 --> 00:21:04,360
[A Closer Look at
Billionaire 'Witaya Rungruengumporn'

415
00:21:04,370 --> 00:21:06,030
and 'Linlin', His Actress Daughter]

416
00:21:06,080 --> 00:21:07,510
Are they related?

417
00:21:08,210 --> 00:21:09,590
Or do they just share a surname?

418
00:21:10,590 --> 00:21:12,070
Could they be father and daughter?

419
00:21:13,890 --> 00:21:15,490
How could they be father and daughter?

420
00:21:15,510 --> 00:21:17,680
He's a billionaire,

421
00:21:17,700 --> 00:21:19,800
so why is she working
as a feng shui master?

422
00:21:22,210 --> 00:21:23,210
Right.

423
00:21:23,590 --> 00:21:24,590
Why?

424
00:21:25,510 --> 00:21:28,080
Why do I need to care
about this feng shui lady?

425
00:21:28,100 --> 00:21:28,830
Gosh!

426
00:21:34,430 --> 00:21:38,710
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

427
00:22:08,040 --> 00:22:09,800
Recorded successfully.

428
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:19,030
I'm sorry.

429
00:22:19,410 --> 00:22:21,590
It's okay, you can go first.

430
00:22:22,310 --> 00:22:23,590
Uhh...

431
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:25,470
You must be a client.

432
00:22:25,490 --> 00:22:27,000
You can go first.

433
00:22:32,900 --> 00:22:34,300
Recorded successfully.

434
00:22:34,320 --> 00:22:35,590
Thank you.

435
00:22:44,200 --> 00:22:45,200
Thank you.

436
00:22:50,890 --> 00:22:52,200
I'm Mim,

437
00:22:52,220 --> 00:22:54,430
an interior designer here.

438
00:22:54,780 --> 00:22:55,990
I'm Lada.

439
00:22:56,010 --> 00:22:58,310
I’m thinking of renovating
the old building at my place,

440
00:22:58,330 --> 00:22:59,680
so I'd like a consultation.

441
00:23:00,690 --> 00:23:02,490
It’s a pleasure!

442
00:23:02,510 --> 00:23:05,590
Do you have any specific designs
or preferences in mind?

443
00:23:05,910 --> 00:23:07,590
Or would you like me to
make some suggestions?

444
00:23:07,700 --> 00:23:09,260
Mmm...

445
00:23:09,380 --> 00:23:10,380
I do.

446
00:23:10,570 --> 00:23:14,560
For my preference, I like...

447
00:23:19,080 --> 00:23:20,970
something interesting,

448
00:23:21,590 --> 00:23:24,070
especially if it's pretty.

449
00:23:33,970 --> 00:23:35,190
Oh.

450
00:23:35,380 --> 00:23:37,710
In that case, I think I know

451
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:39,110
what you'd like.

452
00:23:41,870 --> 00:23:43,230
I'll leave it to you, then.

453
00:23:44,230 --> 00:23:45,430
My pleasure.

454
00:23:46,060 --> 00:23:47,930
I'm glad to have met you today.

455
00:23:50,560 --> 00:23:52,190
I'm also glad

456
00:23:52,370 --> 00:23:54,590
to be your

457
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:56,190
interior designer.

458
00:24:13,310 --> 00:24:15,810
Hello, this is Feng Shui by Xinxin.

459
00:24:16,030 --> 00:24:17,710
Lada!

460
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:20,750
When did you get back?
Why didn't you tell me?

461
00:24:20,770 --> 00:24:22,430
And why are you calling from
some random number?

462
00:24:22,450 --> 00:24:24,010
Did you change your number
without telling me?

463
00:24:24,030 --> 00:24:25,750
Wait, wait. Calm down.

464
00:24:25,770 --> 00:24:27,310
One question at a time.

465
00:24:28,290 --> 00:24:29,910
Give me some breathing room.

466
00:24:30,210 --> 00:24:32,770
Tell me everything.
Don't even think about hiding anything.

467
00:24:32,990 --> 00:24:35,210
I've been back for two or three days,

468
00:24:35,230 --> 00:24:36,120
and I'm kind of busy.

469
00:24:36,150 --> 00:24:38,030
My father handed over the business to me,

470
00:24:38,050 --> 00:24:39,950
so I have a few things to sort out.

471
00:24:40,350 --> 00:24:42,100
I just talked to a designer,

472
00:24:42,120 --> 00:24:43,120
and it was amazing.

473
00:24:43,290 --> 00:24:45,270
Gosh, I miss you!

474
00:24:45,290 --> 00:24:47,870
So does this mean
we're finally back together?

475
00:24:47,910 --> 00:24:48,710
Mm!

476
00:24:51,300 --> 00:24:53,910
Wait, what about your phone number?

477
00:24:54,100 --> 00:24:55,270
Well, a feng shui master...

478
00:24:55,520 --> 00:24:57,490
told me to change it, so I did.

479
00:24:57,510 --> 00:24:59,310
I changed it just like you told me to.

480
00:24:59,340 --> 00:25:02,070
Lucky number: four, five, six,
slaying every single event.

481
00:25:02,490 --> 00:25:05,000
Master Xinxin charges a fortune.

482
00:25:05,030 --> 00:25:06,910
Who wouldn't believe that, right?

483
00:25:08,690 --> 00:25:09,690
Well, there is someone.

484
00:25:09,710 --> 00:25:10,930
Someone who doesn't believe that.

485
00:25:10,950 --> 00:25:12,150
There's this one person.

486
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:13,480
Who?

487
00:25:13,500 --> 00:25:14,590
Your customer?

488
00:25:15,600 --> 00:25:19,190
Every single customer
believes what I told them,

489
00:25:19,510 --> 00:25:21,830
but this time, it's an architect.

490
00:25:22,500 --> 00:25:23,680
Normally,

491
00:25:23,700 --> 00:25:25,400
I never lose.

492
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:27,150
But this architect

493
00:25:27,320 --> 00:25:28,550
was a tough one.

494
00:25:29,780 --> 00:25:32,630
Feng shui masters and architects
never get along anyway, do they?

495
00:25:33,300 --> 00:25:34,480
You're right,

496
00:25:34,500 --> 00:25:36,890
but I never thought
we’d hate each other this much.

497
00:25:43,980 --> 00:25:45,210
Hello?

498
00:25:46,800 --> 00:25:47,800
Yes, I am.

499
00:25:49,690 --> 00:25:50,690
Who?

500
00:26:07,380 --> 00:26:08,830
Seriously, Miss Architect,

501
00:26:08,850 --> 00:26:10,870
do you have to be an omen
of bad luck every day?

502
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:16,000
Take a seat.

503
00:26:16,270 --> 00:26:17,710
It won't take long.

504
00:26:18,310 --> 00:26:19,310
Then I'll stand.

505
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:21,690
That's inconvenient.

506
00:26:22,140 --> 00:26:23,490
Not for me.

507
00:26:32,100 --> 00:26:33,590
What do you want to talk about?

508
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:37,090
Did Madam Waen tell you

509
00:26:37,110 --> 00:26:38,590
that I'm still in charge of this project?

510
00:26:39,310 --> 00:26:40,510
Are you hard up for money?

511
00:26:41,020 --> 00:26:43,310
Why wouldn't I want money?

512
00:26:43,890 --> 00:26:45,230
Don't you?

513
00:26:51,850 --> 00:26:53,550
Here, look.

514
00:26:53,940 --> 00:26:56,550
I revised the house design
as you suggested,

515
00:26:56,930 --> 00:26:58,540
but let me make one thing clear.

516
00:26:58,560 --> 00:27:00,980
This will be the final revision.

517
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,950
And don't you dare pitch
any more weird ideas

518
00:27:03,086 --> 00:27:04,413
to Madam Waen.

519
00:27:07,790 --> 00:27:08,380
Hey.

520
00:27:09,090 --> 00:27:11,310
Isn't the fountain too large,
Miss Architect?

521
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:13,000
But you said

522
00:27:13,020 --> 00:27:14,280
it was too small.

523
00:27:14,890 --> 00:27:16,570
But if it's this large,

524
00:27:16,600 --> 00:27:18,030
it'll be a waterfall instead.

525
00:27:20,710 --> 00:27:21,510
And...

526
00:27:21,710 --> 00:27:23,590
how many lights did you put in?

527
00:27:23,610 --> 00:27:24,390
Twenty.

528
00:27:25,080 --> 00:27:26,070
Twenty?!

529
00:27:26,420 --> 00:27:27,150
Mm.

530
00:27:27,310 --> 00:27:28,890
You're the one who said

531
00:27:28,910 --> 00:27:30,430
it had to be an even number.

532
00:27:30,700 --> 00:27:32,350
So how is twenty not even?

533
00:27:34,130 --> 00:27:36,800
With this many lights,
the place might as well be an oven.

534
00:27:36,820 --> 00:27:38,230
Four would be enough.

535
00:27:41,290 --> 00:27:43,320
And these stairs.

536
00:27:43,340 --> 00:27:44,750
Why make them spiral?

537
00:27:45,030 --> 00:27:47,190
In case Madam Waen gets lazy,

538
00:27:47,490 --> 00:27:48,990
she can slide down them.

539
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:53,630
Are you really an architect?

540
00:27:58,410 --> 00:27:59,750
This is the actual design.

541
00:28:01,790 --> 00:28:03,110
Then what was that one?

542
00:28:03,600 --> 00:28:05,110
I made it for fun.

543
00:28:06,500 --> 00:28:07,500
Got nothing to do?

544
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:20,200
It looks good.

545
00:28:20,870 --> 00:28:21,650
Okay,

546
00:28:22,320 --> 00:28:24,150
then I'll send it to Pailin.

547
00:28:25,000 --> 00:28:26,910
Whatever, I'm leaving.

548
00:28:45,390 --> 00:28:46,510
What's that?

549
00:28:47,190 --> 00:28:48,190
An inhaler.

550
00:28:49,120 --> 00:28:51,300
I know it's an inhaler,

551
00:28:51,530 --> 00:28:53,020
but why are you giving it to me?

552
00:28:53,950 --> 00:28:56,250
Green is a lucky color.

553
00:28:56,270 --> 00:28:59,850
Maybe you should carry something
that isn't bad luck for once.

554
00:29:00,250 --> 00:29:02,810
I haven't used it. You can have it.

555
00:29:04,020 --> 00:29:05,620
Why would I need it?

556
00:29:06,970 --> 00:29:09,830
So you can stop looking so annoyed

557
00:29:09,850 --> 00:29:11,820
every time you see my face.

558
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:16,420
So...

559
00:29:17,220 --> 00:29:18,820
you still want to see me?

560
00:29:50,980 --> 00:29:52,550
[Pailin]

561
00:29:53,940 --> 00:29:55,610
Hello, Pailin.

562
00:29:55,630 --> 00:29:57,160
Hello, Soul.

563
00:29:57,190 --> 00:29:59,090
I'm calling to let you know that

564
00:29:59,110 --> 00:30:00,940
Madam was very happy with

565
00:30:01,036 --> 00:30:03,180
the revised house design you submitted.

566
00:30:03,260 --> 00:30:06,030
You can go ahead with the next steps.

567
00:30:06,050 --> 00:30:07,453
Really?

568
00:30:07,570 --> 00:30:09,940
Then I'll proceed with it.

569
00:30:09,990 --> 00:30:11,420
Thank you so much.

570
00:30:15,750 --> 00:30:17,130
Finally!

571
00:30:17,150 --> 00:30:19,120
Let's call it a day!

572
00:30:40,940 --> 00:30:42,410
Goodbye,

573
00:30:42,800 --> 00:30:43,903
Miss Feng Shui.
[Block]

574
00:30:51,850 --> 00:30:54,110
Madam approved the latest design.

575
00:30:54,130 --> 00:30:55,880
Let us never meet again,

576
00:30:55,900 --> 00:30:58,000
Miss Feng... Shui!

577
00:30:58,420 --> 00:31:01,100
Yes, yes, yes!

578
00:31:02,120 --> 00:31:05,220
As if I'd want to see you, Miss Architect.

579
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:11,830
Mom,

580
00:31:11,850 --> 00:31:13,580
I'm coming home.

581
00:31:13,780 --> 00:31:16,900
Please get the dinner ready!

582
00:31:25,460 --> 00:31:26,250
Here you go, dear.

583
00:31:26,280 --> 00:31:27,280
Thank you.

584
00:31:29,470 --> 00:31:30,860
Whoa...

585
00:31:30,980 --> 00:31:33,180
There's so much food today.

586
00:31:33,330 --> 00:31:35,786
It's just the two of us, Mom.

587
00:31:35,860 --> 00:31:38,610
You said everything went well today,

588
00:31:38,690 --> 00:31:40,570
so we have to celebrate.

589
00:31:43,150 --> 00:31:44,130
So...

590
00:31:44,150 --> 00:31:45,680
what did you do

591
00:31:45,700 --> 00:31:47,720
to get the architect to agree with you?

592
00:31:49,090 --> 00:31:51,110
Maybe it's because

593
00:31:51,130 --> 00:31:54,240
I stepped out of the house
with my left foot today.

594
00:31:56,930 --> 00:31:57,720
Shall we eat?

595
00:31:57,740 --> 00:31:58,450
Right.

596
00:32:02,320 --> 00:32:03,140
Here,

597
00:32:03,810 --> 00:32:05,110
have some more

598
00:32:05,130 --> 00:32:08,320
to fill you up a little.

599
00:32:10,630 --> 00:32:11,570
Thanks, Mom.

600
00:32:15,430 --> 00:32:16,430
Oh,

601
00:32:16,930 --> 00:32:17,930
Xinxin.

602
00:32:18,310 --> 00:32:20,500
Your dad called today.

603
00:32:21,510 --> 00:32:25,320
He asked how you were doing.

604
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:32,420
The food is so good, Mom.

605
00:32:33,410 --> 00:32:35,780
Please don't ruin my appetite.

606
00:32:53,750 --> 00:33:02,930
[Madam Waen]

607
00:33:10,080 --> 00:33:11,920
Hello...

608
00:33:15,130 --> 00:33:16,280
Another revision?!

609
00:33:16,300 --> 00:33:18,200
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

610
00:33:18,370 --> 00:33:19,520
Where are you going, Soul?

611
00:33:19,540 --> 00:33:20,610
To Madam Waen's house.

612
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:21,640
- No!
- You can't!

613
00:33:21,930 --> 00:33:23,670
Calm down! Don't go yet!

614
00:33:23,700 --> 00:33:25,120
Let go of me!

615
00:33:25,140 --> 00:33:26,180
You can't go, Soul!

616
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:27,330
If you go there now,

617
00:33:27,350 --> 00:33:28,480
her house will go up in flames

618
00:33:28,500 --> 00:33:30,610
without us even lighting
twenty light bulbs.

619
00:33:30,630 --> 00:33:31,520
That's right.

620
00:33:31,540 --> 00:33:33,100
Please calm down first.

621
00:33:33,120 --> 00:33:34,300
You can't go.

622
00:33:34,320 --> 00:33:35,970
Madam Waen is our VIP client,

623
00:33:35,990 --> 00:33:37,370
and the boss won't put up with this.

624
00:33:37,400 --> 00:33:38,710
Think about it.

625
00:33:38,910 --> 00:33:39,820
Calm down.

626
00:33:39,840 --> 00:33:40,930
How about this?

627
00:33:40,950 --> 00:33:43,250
Why don't you talk to
that feng shui master, Xinxin, first?

628
00:33:43,270 --> 00:33:44,310
- That's right.
- Please...

629
00:33:44,330 --> 00:33:46,210
Calm down.

630
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:01,280
Oh...

631
00:34:01,300 --> 00:34:02,790
you blocked me?

632
00:34:03,090 --> 00:34:04,640
Are we doing this now?

633
00:34:04,660 --> 00:34:08,480
[Block]

634
00:34:08,510 --> 00:34:10,700
Why did you block her, then?

635
00:34:10,720 --> 00:34:12,000
Yeah.

636
00:34:12,030 --> 00:34:12,990
What was that about?

637
00:34:13,010 --> 00:34:14,720
You finished the job, and that was it?

638
00:34:15,710 --> 00:34:17,500
I didn't have anything else to say to her.

639
00:34:17,830 --> 00:34:19,300
And do you now?

640
00:34:19,910 --> 00:34:20,800
Yeah.

641
00:34:20,990 --> 00:34:22,620
Don't make me start...

642
00:34:24,680 --> 00:34:25,700
I'm sorry...

643
00:34:28,010 --> 00:34:29,610
Give me your phone.

644
00:34:30,420 --> 00:34:31,620
I'll talk to her.

645
00:34:33,410 --> 00:34:34,410
Gimme.

646
00:34:43,110 --> 00:34:44,290
Well...

647
00:34:46,020 --> 00:34:47,400
She blocked you too.

648
00:34:50,320 --> 00:34:52,100
What should we do now...

649
00:34:52,120 --> 00:34:54,310
Hello, Feng Shui Master Xinxin.

650
00:34:54,330 --> 00:34:56,500
This is Mim, one of Soul's team members.

651
00:34:56,520 --> 00:34:58,960
Soul's phone has been acting up,

652
00:34:58,980 --> 00:35:00,960
and it accidentally
blocked all her contacts.

653
00:35:06,830 --> 00:35:08,210
I bet something's going on.

654
00:35:08,720 --> 00:35:10,420
I think...

655
00:35:10,730 --> 00:35:12,010
thing is about to get real juicy.

656
00:35:13,210 --> 00:35:14,730
Keep your ears open, Mek,

657
00:35:14,750 --> 00:35:16,330
so we can tell Pat too.

658
00:35:16,350 --> 00:35:18,240
Soul is working on it now,

659
00:35:18,260 --> 00:35:20,900
but I'd like to ask you

660
00:35:20,930 --> 00:35:23,210
to please unblock Soul's number.

661
00:35:23,230 --> 00:35:25,410
We still have some work to discuss,

662
00:35:25,430 --> 00:35:27,530
and I understand there may
have been a misunderstanding.

663
00:35:27,550 --> 00:35:30,010
I sincerely apologize on
Soul's behalf again,

664
00:35:30,030 --> 00:35:32,710
or you can contact me instead.

665
00:35:33,910 --> 00:35:35,330
Done.

666
00:35:35,350 --> 00:35:37,010
Looking good and clever,

667
00:35:37,040 --> 00:35:38,620
like we've got a master plan.

668
00:35:38,650 --> 00:35:39,880
Damn,

669
00:35:40,150 --> 00:35:41,620
who would believe that?

670
00:35:42,310 --> 00:35:44,100
Ugh, Oyl!

671
00:35:44,120 --> 00:35:47,180
If you're not helping,
just sit there quietly.

672
00:35:47,200 --> 00:35:48,940
I don't need your opinions.

673
00:35:49,190 --> 00:35:49,970
Hey,

674
00:35:49,990 --> 00:35:50,890
let's think about it.

675
00:35:50,910 --> 00:35:52,610
An architect and a feng shui master...

676
00:35:52,630 --> 00:35:54,240
how could they ever stay apart?

677
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:55,890
Seriously,

678
00:35:55,910 --> 00:35:57,220
you have to tell Soul

679
00:35:57,240 --> 00:35:58,480
that...

680
00:35:58,500 --> 00:35:59,490
next time,

681
00:35:59,510 --> 00:36:01,850
she shouldn't block people willy-nilly.

682
00:36:01,970 --> 00:36:02,970
Getting bold lately, huh?

683
00:36:05,330 --> 00:36:07,660
I'm sorry. I just want to...

684
00:36:07,690 --> 00:36:09,420
talk some sense into you.

685
00:36:10,500 --> 00:36:11,730
Uh, no...

686
00:36:11,750 --> 00:36:14,480
I just, uh...want to be

687
00:36:14,510 --> 00:36:16,110
your thinking partner and supporter,

688
00:36:16,130 --> 00:36:17,990
because you're my leader,

689
00:36:18,010 --> 00:36:18,920
and I'm your subordinate,

690
00:36:18,940 --> 00:36:20,700
so you know what you're doing, of course.

691
00:36:20,840 --> 00:36:22,480
Right, Mim?

692
00:36:22,500 --> 00:36:23,610
- Hey.
- Look at you!

693
00:36:24,210 --> 00:36:25,920
- Don't ask me for help.
- Oh...

694
00:36:26,210 --> 00:36:27,270
Enough.

695
00:36:27,300 --> 00:36:28,720
The task I assigned you

696
00:36:28,740 --> 00:36:30,160
is due today.

697
00:36:30,300 --> 00:36:31,400
- Yes...
- Don't slack off.

698
00:36:31,420 --> 00:36:33,500
- Understood...
- Even if I'm not at the desk,

699
00:36:33,520 --> 00:36:35,730
the deadline is still today. Understand?

700
00:36:35,900 --> 00:36:37,110
Understood.

701
00:36:38,700 --> 00:36:40,100
Getting called out on your work now, huh?

702
00:37:00,520 --> 00:37:02,600
Hello, Miss Architect.

703
00:37:03,420 --> 00:37:05,930
Do you know Madam Waen
wants us to revise the design again?

704
00:37:06,530 --> 00:37:07,570
I do.

705
00:37:07,590 --> 00:37:09,330
What does that have to do with me?

706
00:37:09,490 --> 00:37:10,820
It does!

707
00:37:10,840 --> 00:37:12,380
It's because of your suggestions

708
00:37:12,410 --> 00:37:14,680
that Madam Waen keeps
asking for endless revisions.

709
00:37:14,820 --> 00:37:18,350
Seriously, did you put
ideas in her head again?

710
00:37:18,370 --> 00:37:19,310
Gosh,

711
00:37:19,330 --> 00:37:21,730
I'm not that free, you know.

712
00:37:23,310 --> 00:37:24,460
Okay,

713
00:37:24,490 --> 00:37:27,530
I don't want to waste my time
on one project either.

714
00:37:28,120 --> 00:37:29,700
If I want you

715
00:37:29,720 --> 00:37:31,700
to help revise the blueprint one last time,

716
00:37:31,720 --> 00:37:33,320
will you work with me?

717
00:37:36,610 --> 00:37:38,240
And what do you have to offer in return?

718
00:37:38,500 --> 00:37:39,700
What do you want?

719
00:37:39,830 --> 00:37:40,570
Money.

720
00:37:40,930 --> 00:37:41,660
How much?

721
00:37:42,020 --> 00:37:42,880
Twenty grand.

722
00:37:43,520 --> 00:37:44,790
That's too much!

723
00:37:45,280 --> 00:37:46,670
How much are you offering?

724
00:37:46,890 --> 00:37:47,590
Two thousand.

725
00:37:48,600 --> 00:37:50,870
You've got some nerve, haggling this hard.

726
00:37:51,090 --> 00:37:53,490
Hey, for two thousand,
we won't have to see each other again.

727
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:54,920
How is that unfair?

728
00:37:54,940 --> 00:37:56,230
I don't like you.

729
00:37:56,250 --> 00:37:57,410
You don't like me either.

730
00:37:57,650 --> 00:37:58,580
It’s totally worth it.

731
00:37:58,620 --> 00:38:00,110
It's a win-win for both of us, alright?

732
00:38:02,030 --> 00:38:03,020
Deal.

733
00:38:03,040 --> 00:38:04,530
I'll work with you,

734
00:38:04,550 --> 00:38:06,310
so we won't have to see each other again.

735
00:38:07,210 --> 00:38:08,210
Okay.

736
00:38:08,570 --> 00:38:10,330
We won't have to see each other again.

737
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:23,720
Wait...where are you taking me?

738
00:38:24,150 --> 00:38:25,320
My house.

739
00:38:25,500 --> 00:38:26,500
Huh?!

740
00:38:33,040 --> 00:38:34,840
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

741
00:38:36,270 --> 00:38:37,110
So...

742
00:38:37,240 --> 00:38:39,040
why did you bring me here?

743
00:38:39,190 --> 00:38:40,120
Why?

744
00:38:40,140 --> 00:38:41,160
Scared?

745
00:38:42,110 --> 00:38:44,010
Why should I be scared?

746
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:45,250
Good.

747
00:38:45,270 --> 00:38:46,740
If you aren't scared,

748
00:38:46,760 --> 00:38:48,120
then let's head inside.

749
00:38:51,080 --> 00:38:53,580
Sadhu, I hope everything
will go smoothly today.

750
00:38:53,680 --> 00:38:55,430
Hey, wait for me!

751
00:38:56,020 --> 00:38:57,610
Wait!

752
00:38:57,990 --> 00:38:58,770
Ugh...

753
00:39:06,900 --> 00:39:09,500
You wait here for a second,
I'll grab something upstairs.

754
00:39:09,620 --> 00:39:10,620
Hey,

755
00:39:10,730 --> 00:39:12,730
aren't you going to offer
your guest some water?

756
00:39:13,720 --> 00:39:14,840
You're so demanding.

757
00:39:16,510 --> 00:39:17,480
Fine...

758
00:39:17,500 --> 00:39:18,170
I'm leaving.

759
00:39:18,190 --> 00:39:19,670
Hey, you!

760
00:39:20,540 --> 00:39:22,410
Okay, what do you want?

761
00:39:22,600 --> 00:39:24,410
Water or juice?

762
00:39:27,110 --> 00:39:28,110
I'm fine with either.

763
00:39:28,150 --> 00:39:29,620
It's up to you.

764
00:39:52,530 --> 00:39:53,620
What do you say?

765
00:39:57,330 --> 00:39:58,820
Thank you.

766
00:40:14,810 --> 00:40:16,320
This cake is so good!

767
00:40:16,920 --> 00:40:18,500
My mom made it.

768
00:40:23,710 --> 00:40:25,170
Can I...

769
00:40:25,610 --> 00:40:27,520
take some home with me?

770
00:40:32,120 --> 00:40:33,600
I'll save some for you.

771
00:40:44,400 --> 00:40:46,210
Wait here.

772
00:40:46,230 --> 00:40:47,820
I'll go upstairs and grab something.

773
00:41:20,680 --> 00:41:23,270
She was so adorable as a kid,

774
00:41:23,300 --> 00:41:25,410
so how'd she grow up this fierce?

775
00:41:26,980 --> 00:41:28,910
I'm still adorable, though,

776
00:41:32,620 --> 00:41:33,860
but only to some people.

777
00:41:34,730 --> 00:41:35,730
Oh!

778
00:41:40,220 --> 00:41:41,840
You've got a sharp tongue.

779
00:41:44,670 --> 00:41:45,870
Um...

780
00:41:46,230 --> 00:41:47,730
Is your house

781
00:41:48,220 --> 00:41:49,410
right by the water?

782
00:41:51,010 --> 00:41:52,280
Yeah.

783
00:41:52,300 --> 00:41:53,830
Why, Miss Feng Shui?

784
00:41:54,200 --> 00:41:56,810
Is there something wrong with
my house's feng shui?

785
00:41:57,540 --> 00:41:59,010
Nothing.

786
00:41:59,320 --> 00:42:01,520
I just wanted to tell you that

787
00:42:01,980 --> 00:42:03,820
people who choose a house by the water

788
00:42:04,120 --> 00:42:06,850
are actually sensitive,
Miss Architect.

789
00:42:09,120 --> 00:42:10,050
Sensitive,

790
00:42:10,310 --> 00:42:13,400
but like to hide it behind walls.

791
00:42:20,920 --> 00:42:22,210
Am I right?

792
00:42:37,756 --> 00:42:40,820
When will you be back, dear?

793
00:42:40,983 --> 00:42:42,283
Dad came over and is waiting for you

794
00:42:43,560 --> 00:42:44,750
How is that unfair?

795
00:42:44,770 --> 00:42:46,060
I don't like you.

796
00:42:46,080 --> 00:42:47,260
You don't like me either.

797
00:42:47,500 --> 00:42:48,500
It’s totally worth it.

798
00:42:48,520 --> 00:42:49,770
It's a win-win for both of us, alright?

799
00:42:59,900 --> 00:43:02,260
[When will you be back, dear?
Dad came over and is waiting for you]

800
00:43:08,730 --> 00:43:09,730
Deal.

801
00:43:09,760 --> 00:43:11,240
I'll work with you,

802
00:43:11,260 --> 00:43:12,840
so we won't have to see each other again.

803
00:43:20,240 --> 00:43:22,130
I'm sorry, Mom.

804
00:43:22,150 --> 00:43:23,800
I have urgent work today,

805
00:43:23,830 --> 00:43:25,420
so I'll be home late.

806
00:43:32,740 --> 00:43:34,450
Maybe staying here...

807
00:43:34,940 --> 00:43:36,630
is better than going back home.

808
00:44:11,520 --> 00:44:12,630
Oh?!

809
00:44:13,730 --> 00:44:14,650
Hello!

810
00:44:14,750 --> 00:44:15,603
Hi...

811
00:44:17,410 --> 00:44:18,270
Uh...

812
00:44:18,290 --> 00:44:19,700
- are you...
- Oh, I'm...

813
00:44:19,740 --> 00:44:20,510
I'm with...

814
00:44:20,573 --> 00:44:21,340
- Soul...
- Oh.

815
00:44:21,410 --> 00:44:23,190
Are you Soul's girlfriend?

816
00:44:37,180 --> 00:44:38,793
Hope we don’t get to meet again,

817
00:44:38,986 --> 00:44:40,423
Miss Architect.

818
00:44:40,606 --> 00:44:41,980
There’s something between

819
00:44:42,073 --> 00:44:44,126
Miss Feng Shui and Miss Architect, isn’t it?

820
00:44:44,263 --> 00:44:46,706
Did you do this to every client of yours?

821
00:44:47,786 --> 00:44:50,120
If I’m cheering for the boxing,

822
00:44:50,306 --> 00:44:53,060
- I’ll root for this pair.
- Mom!

823
00:44:57,343 --> 00:44:59,260
Did you just trick me here again?

824
00:45:03,440 --> 00:45:05,940
And nine means prosperity.

825
00:45:05,960 --> 00:45:07,070
According to belief,

826
00:45:07,090 --> 00:45:08,600
- living here will bring you...
- Hey,

827
00:45:08,630 --> 00:45:10,130
we can't have any drama today,

828
00:45:10,150 --> 00:45:11,150
okay?

829
00:45:12,580 --> 00:45:13,620
The other day

830
00:45:13,640 --> 00:45:16,030
when you blew up at
Vikrom's feng shui master,

831
00:45:16,050 --> 00:45:18,040
our boss chewed me out so bad
I’m still traumatized.

832
00:45:18,110 --> 00:45:19,270
How could I not lose it?

833
00:45:19,300 --> 00:45:21,040
He wanted a zigzag spiral staircase,

834
00:45:21,070 --> 00:45:22,450
like a dragon holding a pearl,

835
00:45:22,470 --> 00:45:24,030
with glossy steps

836
00:45:24,050 --> 00:45:25,570
as slippery as a water slide!

837
00:45:25,600 --> 00:45:27,080
I'm going to lose my mind!

838
00:45:27,540 --> 00:45:28,840
Come on.

839
00:45:29,100 --> 00:45:30,100
Okay,

840
00:45:30,260 --> 00:45:31,460
keep repeating this.

841
00:45:31,480 --> 00:45:32,420
Bonus.

842
00:45:32,440 --> 00:45:33,440
Bonus.

843
00:45:33,920 --> 00:45:35,270
Bonus...

844
00:45:35,680 --> 00:45:36,560
Bonus...

845
00:45:36,640 --> 00:45:37,860
But the fountain

846
00:45:37,880 --> 00:45:39,450
should be on the left

847
00:45:39,470 --> 00:45:40,640
to bring peace to the house.

848
00:45:40,660 --> 00:45:42,490
- If it's slightly to the right,
- "Bonus..."

849
00:45:42,510 --> 00:45:44,250
- there'll be an imbalance between water and fire,
- "Bonus..."

850
00:45:44,270 --> 00:45:45,630
- like Yin and Yang.
- "Bonus..."

851
00:45:45,660 --> 00:45:47,130
This area should be adjusted.

852
00:45:47,160 --> 00:45:48,030
Not a chance!

853
00:45:48,050 --> 00:45:48,970
